# 📘 TOEFL Academic Vocabulary - Day32

| Word | Meaning | Example |
|---|---|---|
| infer | 추론하다 | Researchers can infer the cause from the data. |
| significant | 중요한, 상당한 | The study found a significant difference. |
| emerge | 나타나다, 부상하다 | New patterns began to emerge. |

---

## Synonyms

### infer
→ conclude / deduce

### significant
→ important / considerable

### emerge
→ appear / arise

---

## Useful Collocations

infer from the evidence
→ 증거로부터 추론하다

significant difference
→ 상당한 차이

significant impact
→ 상당한 영향

emerge from
→ ~에서 나타나다

